Package: memscore
Title: R Interface to the Memscore Command Line Tools
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Brad", "Buchsbaum", email = "brad.buchsbaum@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Native R wrappers for the memscore Python tooling.
    The package scores image memorability, runs challenger benchmarks,
    evaluates the standard frozen CLIP ensemble, and launches repeated
    FIGRIM studies through either an optional reticulate backend or an
    external command line backend.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://bbuchsbaum.github.io/memscore/,
    https://github.com/bbuchsbaum/memscore
